WEBVTT

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:01.445
That means knowing when to say no.

00:04:01.821 --> 00:04:04.824
For me, that's meant
turning down outside capital.

00:04:04.865 --> 00:04:07.368
Yeah, that extra cash flow
would have been amazing,

00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:11.914
but investors would want to maximize
profits and in turn,

00:04:11.956 --> 00:04:15.793
compromise a community
and culture aspects of what we stand for.

00:04:15.835 --> 00:04:19.088
And for me, that's non-negotiable.

00:04:19.588 --> 00:04:21.924
At the end of the day,
you have to be grateful.

00:04:21.966 --> 00:04:25.219
No one has to work for you,
and no one has to be your customer.

00:04:25.219 --> 00:04:26.387
People have choices,

00:04:26.387 --> 00:04:29.724
so remember to appreciate
every employee effort

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.267
and every sale.